{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["<b>ביום, מצלות</b> — from the same root as תצלינה. Bells hung on the necks of the horses going up to the festivals — the priests will make from them pots to cook in, and they will be as numerous as the sprinkling-basins before the altar, for sprinkling the blood."], :book :zechariah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 14, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Zecharia -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/zecharya"] ["1" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=25&perek=5&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:47:09.382880175Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}